    howBtn:"How it works", introGo:"Let's go",
    intro:{
      scales:["Scales",["At the top, pick the <b>scales</b>, the <b>key</b> and the <b>direction</b> (up, down or both).","<b>Notes</b>: play the scale note by note. <b>Chords</b>: play the 7 chords of the scale in a row, one per degree (I, II, III…), with a 7th-chords option.","Play the scale <b>note by note</b> on your piano (MIDI, mic or on-screen keys): each right note fills a box.","Stuck? <b>Show me</b> reveals the answer step by step. A game has 10 exercises: play them cleanly to earn more XP and build your combo."]],
      chords:["Chords",["You are asked for a chord, for example <b>F Minor</b>.","Play its notes <b>together</b> (MIDI) or <b>one at a time</b>, starting from the lowest.","Turn on <b>inversions</b> to practise positions: 1st inversion = third at the bottom, 2nd = fifth at the bottom. New chords unlock as you level up."]],
      harmony:["Harmony",["Every key has <b>7 chords</b>, one per degree, from I to VII.","You are asked for a degree: <b>IV of C Major</b> is F Major. Play it.","Pick the <b>degrees</b> to practise at the top to focus on I, IV, V… It is the basis of songwriting."]],
      prog:["Progressions",["A progression is a <b>sequence of chords</b> that works, for example I – V – vi – IV.","Play the chords <b>in order</b>. With voice leading on, each chord is played in the inversion closest to the previous one, like a pianist.","At the end, listen to the progression to hear what you built."]],
      ear:["Ear training",["Listen to what is played: a <b>chord</b>, an <b>interval</b> or a <b>scale</b>.","Pick the right answer. Replay as often as you like (Space).","Categories unlock as you level up."]],
      games:["Games",["<b>Note Jumper</b>: you are a running piano. A chord is written above each note.","Play that chord, ideally while the note crosses the <b>circle</b> (“Perfect!” bonus): the piano jumps by itself. The chord's keys light up on the keyboard when the hint is on.","Play a <b>{C}</b> to start or try again. More games are coming soon."]],
      daily:["Daily practice",["Every day, <b>10 mixed exercises</b> from all sections.","Exercises you miss <b>come back</b> on the following days (spaced repetition) until you know them.","The <b>timeline</b> at the top shows your progress. Finish it to keep your streak."]]},
