    mdFix:[["No keyboard in the list","Keyboard off or asleep","Turn your keyboard on (some switch off by themselves after 30 min)."],["Cable plugged in, still nothing","Charge-only cable (no data)","Some cables only charge. Try another cable, ideally the one that came with the keyboard."],["Nothing on the iPad (Lightning)","Adapter without power, or an old adapter","Use the Lightning to USB 3 adapter and plug the iPad into power."],["The browser blocks MIDI","MIDI permission refused","Allow MIDI: click the padlock left of the address › MIDI devices › Allow, then reload the page."],["Nothing on Windows, but it works elsewhere","Port already used by another app","Close other music software and other Piano Challenges tabs, then unplug and replug the keyboard."],["Bluetooth: the keyboard doesn't show up","Connected elsewhere, or Bluetooth off","Disconnect it from your phone or computer, switch on the keyboard's Bluetooth, then search again."],["Bluetooth: dropouts","Low batteries, too far, interference","Change the batteries, get within 2 m, or use a cable."],["Keyboard seen, no notes","It may send on its 2nd port","Pick the other port in the list of the MIDI keyboard window."],["Digital piano: no notes","Cable in the wrong USB socket","On your piano, use the square “USB to Host” socket, not the one for USB sticks."],["Notes sound twice","Piano sound + app sound","Mute the app sound: your piano plays its own."],["Notes shifted by an octave","Small keyboard, octave set on the keyboard","The app follows by itself. Otherwise, measure the range again."],["Lag between key and sound","Bluetooth, or Bluetooth headphones","For rhythm, prefer a cable and avoid Bluetooth headphones. You can also sync the timing."],["Round sockets only","Older piano without USB","You need a USB-MIDI interface: the piano's MIDI OUT goes into the interface's input."]],
